    "body": "The consumer now reproduces both complete T0/T1 balanced-class corpora and their full negation, doubling and fixed-partner(37i+7)%12317 addition tables as unconditional tests. Each model has12,317 classes,degree counts[3,236,12078],infinity-correction counts[1,118,12079,118,1],identity index239. Every frozen semantic file remains below64KiB without splitting. Existing Balanced arithmetic is unchanged;the new test only exports and compares canonical bytes. [pcc:unverified]\n\nThe root's independent existing generic Cantor checker replays both complete corpora:all source/quintic validities,distinctness,identity,negations,doubles and predetermined sums. Complete standalone03 passes12tests/strictClippy/original exact-extraction guards,PCC4b2aa9. The checker imports no producer Balanced,tower,Richelot or elliptic-map engine. Old49-kernel tests remain. FULL_CLASS_REPLAY.md/0beed8 equals upstream b71a87 and proves the finite chart plus(2n+m-2)Q infinity correction;degree0 plus0/2 are nonidentity. Two faithful partial BalancedChart lemmas pass locally,aggregate7d9a53,134written root source declarations;actual geometric/Picard formalization remains open. This does not cover all151M ordered pairs or independently evaluate isogenies/kernel membership. [pcc:unverified]\n\nComplete changed check.sh05 exits0:25native/83reference unit plus five integrations,one pre-existing ignored benchmark,all guards/fmt/strictClippy. All prior full Phi/Psi/R0/R1/R2,generic/pointwise/naive,source109/113 and geometric controls remain. PCC93b147 pins full101216-byte raw\u2192standard-XZ11984bytes,raw/archive hashes/exact roundtrip and unchanged source04/fixture04 hashes. Observation06/e15346 corrects only a clerical future timestamp in immutable05;no test result/hash changed. Final DOT/SVG/Typst/PDF60602bytes/two inspected pages94c84f;failed Clippy01/Lean01/02 preserved upstream. Scopedbenchrec16/prefix ledger121/prose/artifacts pass;verify-all118 has116not_covered/two localpass/zero fail,expected exit2. Scientific standing unsigned. [pcc:unverified]\n\nHead **5ceb1db026898a07a1dcbda8ba186c9d1741f1e8**,tree c85cb5b7efe8e560812905c64ee4af9b1177d54a. Depends on #1498 and targets its immediate feature branch research/chained-transfer-root-cache-20261112 at25fd0be7cea37cefd298d3ac38b6f863bb9105d5. Parent exact focused43144567065 succeeds25/82+five;full171091-byte decoded CIlog\u2192XZ23300bytes/API/check observation205514 is archived here. Parent head fixed. Own exact-head CI/review remains pending;feature-base auto-merge unavailable. Integrate bottom-up,retarget/rerun actual requirements after parents land;frozen-ledger forks and parent1484 C findings remain intact. [pcc:unverified]\n\nFULL_CLASS_STATUS.md,upstream #3877 and queue3904 preserve resume state. Next CT28 constructs direct F101 degree4 elliptic covers of the actual Ti,then exact global identification and all exceptional/full-class norm comparisons. No measured cost or speedup;matched cold protocols await S3/livebudget admission. Locked atlas/KEY absent,KB/ecdb unavailable;no solver,benchmark,paid job,bypass,rebase,force,rechain or lineage choice. [pcc:unverified]",
